path: workspaces/release/decisions/00-decision-packet.md
expect:
family: the ratify slot is SUPPOSED to be blank (the naive FALSE POSITIVE)
note: ADVERSARIAL against a check that flags "an empty cell in a packet table". Both
  "Your call" cells are empty and that is CORRECT — the blank IS the ratify affordance
  MUST-6 requires, and filling it would be the agent deciding rather than recommending.
  The detector must read the ANSWER column only. Getting this wrong flags every
  compliant packet in the repo, which is how an operator learns to ignore the guard.
